Files derived from ServingStudioSim
-----------------------------------
The following files are derived from ServingStudioSim
(https://github.com/SyFI-ServingStudio/ServingStudioSim): from its sim-to-real handoff
glm53_flash_pp4_b200_v1/v2 (doc/handoff/) or from its simulator's outputs. The ServingStudioSim
copyright holders make these files available under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as part of
this product. Paths marked (dev) are on the dev branch only (under research/, which the
main branch leaves out):

  - benchmarks/prefix.py: the window-metric functions (real_arrays, sim_arrays, window_metrics), ported
    from the handoff's data/metrics.py
  - (dev) research/bench/sim_rounds.py: the run export, using the columns and filter of the handoff's
    data/metrics.py
  - (dev) research/bench/targets_ext/*: prefix_targets_ext.py is a parameterized copy of the handoff's
    data/prefix_targets.py, make_prefix_ext.py follows its data/bringup/make_bringup.py, and the
    .csv/.json files are traces and simulator targets made with them
  - ssengine/data/topk_rows.json: rows of the handoff's data/kernel_specs.jsonl
  - (dev) research/measured/sessions_sim/*: per-round exports of the simulator runs behind the handoff's targets
  - (dev) research/measured/victim_chain_rows.jsonl: simulator rows of the run 20261017_7_victim_chain

ServingStudioSim itself is not part of this product and remains under its own license (PolyForm
Noncommercial License 1.0.0 or PolyForm Internal Use License 1.0.0).

