    (flashinfer/kda_kernels/persistent/forward.py, https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer),
    licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  - docker/seccomp.json is Docker's default seccomp profile from moby
    (https://github.com/moby/moby, vendor/github.com/moby/profiles/seccomp/default.json at
    3d80467678f6e36325fa9ae3dd486fe91e5652e3), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
    with the three io_uring syscalls added by docker/make_seccomp.py.
